6743148111", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391923_592606746481444_8966562253819213417_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mVZKzNJT58MQ7kNvwFwzkKn&_nc_oc=AdoddlsQNpCXQ6u-dC9A9sPgnTOIaok9vh8IuKaC_2gCggonIzXCbicGxhZAsS0-TnE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO1pLLIMGnngLfCdWxJNCdkHwK64mXj_PGY90eZ4TVr3w&oe=6ADF7AD5"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "3508709025927990", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391985_3508709029261323_3016583868344724243_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_L0wR5Nqwe4Q7kNvwFcPoxg&_nc_oc=Adp-VXN6Mih3mNeIQNBVOvtr1Vv3LVwXPBcKtAjsJZ9mLA49I-SY1nU3ejmVomcnDG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPmE4L7kAd6H263P6dDcVjEH1PcW-6q4IKNcJVvtI3tqA&oe=6ADF4CA7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1333140684643275", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391976_1333140687976608_7978945902575114739_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-BItAjBrgYkQ7kNvwH1NUQp&_nc_oc=AdrGUWF05z71sp8qnJeT8LcGlwNx1nn_6N0RaVoIzGh2CYkondtUoRzalHuLpf-5he4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP-PtbUIkDT6I8L_vWiwdeW2K2U3BbNDIHD9arP6WFF-A&oe=6ADF5110"}, "display_name": "Fit Beat Combat : Free Style Boxing", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Boxing"], "long_description": "# Catch the Rhythm, Punch Your Way to Fit in VR!\n\nTired of boring workouts? Ready to **truly enjoy** getting fit? Welcome to **Fit Beat Combat Boxing**! Experience an exhilarating **VR fitness game** on Meta Quest where rhythm meets power! This isn't just another game \u2013 it's your personal boxing ring, high-energy dance floor, and path to a healthier, stronger you. An addictive **VR workout** challenge!\n\n# Feel the Beat, Land the Punch!\n\nDynamic VR arenas meet heart-pumping music. Simple controls: put on your Quest headset (2, 3, or Pro) & move! Notes sync to infectious beats. Unleash your inner champion! **Jab, cross, hook, and uppercut** notes with precision. **Duck and weave** past obstacles, keeping your body moving and heart rate soaring. Intuitive, exhilarating, fun **full-body workout** to make you sweat! Perfect for cardio and calorie burning!\n\n# Your Personal Coach Awaits!\n\nYou're not alone. Our expert **virtual instructor** guides form, pushes you, & cheers you on. Learn technique and feel the burn. Adapts for **beginners** to **fitness pros** to keep you motivated.\n\n# Workout Your Way!\n\nDitch boring apps & gyms! **Fit Beat Combat Boxing** is your fun, effective fitness routine. Smash beats to reach goals like **weight loss**, boosting **stamina**, improving **coordination**, or **stress relief**!\n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Rhythm Boxing Gameplay:** Punch, duck, dodge to music! Music & exercise.\n- **Full-Body Workout:** Arms, core, legs workout for max calorie burn.\n- **Engaging Soundtrack:** Energizing music keeps you moving.\n\n\n", "short_description": "Rhythm Boxing Fitness! Get fit having fun with music & coaching! Thrilling full-body workout on Meta Quest. Quit boring exercises & achieve your ideal body!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_inp